research/audit/wave7-refuter-tasks/cex-ratio-inconclusive-root-decides.md-640-[L4] The root test: for a family from $1$, $\limsup_k |a_{k+1}|^{1/(k+1)} < 1$ gives convergence of $\sum_{k \ge 1}|a_k|$ and hence of $\sum_{k \ge 1} a_k$, and $> 1$ gives divergence of $\sum_{k \ge 1} a_k$ ([[thm-root-test]]).
