research/audit/wave7-dispatch/audit-beta-real-analysis-series.log-447720-+          "quote": "1. if $\\limsup_{k} q_k < 1$ then $\\sum |a_k|$ converges, and hence $\\sum a_k$\n   converges as well ([[lem-absolute-convergence-implies-convergence]]);\n2. if $\\liminf_{k} q_k > 1$ then $\\sum a_k$ diverges.",
