research/audit/wave7-dispatch/audit-beta-real-analysis-series.log:492561:+          "source": "thm-ratio-test",
research/audit/wave7-dispatch/audit-beta-real-analysis-series.log-492562-+          "source_section": "Statement",
research/audit/wave7-dispatch/audit-beta-real-analysis-series.log-492563-+          "quote": "1. if $\\limsup_{k} q_k < 1$ then $\\sum |a_k|$ converges, and hence $\\sum a_k$\n   converges as well ([[lem-absolute-convergence-implies-convergence]]);\n2. if $\\liminf_{k} q_k > 1$ then $\\sum a_k$ diverges.",
research/audit/wave7-dispatch/audit-beta-real-analysis-series.log-492564-+          "uses": [
--
research/audit/wave7-dispatch/audit-beta-real-analysis-series.log-493131-+        },
research/audit/wave7-dispatch/audit-beta-real-analysis-series.log-493132-+        {
research/audit/wave7-dispatch/audit-beta-real-analysis-series.log-493133-+          "fact": "L5",
research/audit/wave7-dispatch/audit-beta-real-analysis-series.log:493134:+          "source": "thm-ratio-test",
research/audit/wave7-dispatch/audit-beta-real-analysis-series.log-493135-+          "source_section": "Statement",
research/audit/wave7-dispatch/audit-beta-real-analysis-series.log-493136-+          "quote": "The hypothesis $a_k \\ne 0$ is what makes $q_k$ exist and is not a convenience: a\nsingle vanishing term leaves the ratio at that index undefined. For a family from\na starting index $m$ the statement is the one above applied to the shifted\nsequence $j \\mapsto a_{j+m}$ ([[def-series]]), whose ratios are\n$|a_{j+m+1}/a_{j+m}|$.",
research/audit/wave7-dispatch/audit-beta-real-analysis-series.log-493137-+          "uses": [
--
research/audit/wave7-dispatch/audit-beta-real-analysis-series.log-494750-+        },
research/audit/wave7-dispatch/audit-beta-real-analysis-series.log-494751-+        {
research/audit/wave7-dispatch/audit-beta-real-analysis-series.log-494752-+          "fact": "L5",
research/audit/wave7-dispatch/audit-beta-real-analysis-series.log:494753:+          "source": "thm-ratio-test",
research/audit/wave7-dispatch/audit-beta-real-analysis-series.log-494754-+          "source_section": "Statement",
research/audit/wave7-dispatch/audit-beta-real-analysis-series.log-494755-+          "quote": "**Nothing is claimed when $\\limsup_k q_k \\ge 1 \\ge \\liminf_k q_k$.** In that\nregime the test is silent, and it has to be: the companion page carries a\nconvergent series whose ratios have limit superior $2$, and both a convergent and\na divergent series with ratio limit exactly $1$.",
