items/ex-raabe-decides-where-ratio-fails.md:56:**Given:** The sequence $a_k := 1/\iota(k+1)^{2}$, $k \in \mathbb{N}$; its ratios $q_k = a_{k+1}/a_k$; and its Raabe expression $R_k = (k+1)(a_k/a_{k+1} - 1)$ ([[cor-raabe-test]], [[def-integer-power]], [[lem-of-naturals-positive]]).
