items/ex-raabe-decides-where-ratio-fails.md-58-[L1] The canonical naturals are positive, so every $a_k$ is positive; reciprocation on the positives is order reversing; and $x^{2} = x\cdot x$ ([[lem-of-naturals-positive]], [[lem-of-inverse-positive]], [[def-integer-power]], [[lem-power-monotone]]).
