items/ex-strict-ratio-root-chain.md:121:  ratio sequence has $\liminf = 0$ and $\limsup = +\infty$, so the ratio data
items/ex-strict-ratio-root-chain.md-122-  place no restriction whatever on the roots beyond the chain, and the chain is
items/ex-strict-ratio-root-chain.md-123-  therefore the sharpest general statement relating the two.
