items/fs-ratio-and-root-limits-always-agree.md:62:**Given:** The alternating sequence $(s_k)$ and the index maps $e, o$ of [[lem-alternating-sequence]]; the sequence $t_k$ defined to be $2$ when $s_k = 1$ and $1/2$ when $s_k = -1$; the sequence $a_k := 2^{-k} t_k$; the ratios $q_k := a_{k+1}/a_k$ and the roots $r_k := a_{k+1}^{1/(k+1)}$.
