items/thm-ratio-root-inequality.md-133-- **All four quantities can be different, and the two outer inequalities can both
items/thm-ratio-root-inequality.md-134-  be strict.** [[ex-strict-ratio-root-chain]] gives a positive sequence with
items/thm-ratio-root-inequality.md-135-  chain $0 < 1/3 < 1/2 < +\infty$, so no two of the four coincide, and
